debian-minerva (0.5.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * UI/UX polish pass against the Aluminium OS reference screenshots:
    rounder floating surfaces (24 px) with layered soft shadows and a light
    theme variant; quick-settings tiles become horizontal pill cards in a
    two-column grid with solid-accent active state; material-style slider
