    tabular-numerals clock; pulsing notification dot; wallpaper depth
    vignette (theme-aware); launcher card hover lift; toast accent edge;
    :focus-visible rings and accent ::selection for accessibility.
  * Status bar scrim now flips light on light wallpapers (readability fix).
  * Launcher: arrow-key navigation through results (Up/Down wraps, Enter
    launches the focused card).
  * Panel open animation uses the spring easing with per-surface transform
    origin (popovers from top-right, launcher from bottom-center).

